				{"name":"Samantha Morton's Honest Playlist with the Guardian","short":"samant(1)","start":"2026-08-23 12:00","end":"2026-08-23 13:00","type":"other","blurb":"The Guardian LIVE is joined by the iconic Samantha Morton. In a highly decorated career, Morton has won a Golden Globe Award, and has been nominated for three BAFTAs, eight BIFAs, an Emmy Award, and two Independent Spirit Awards. She was awarded the Richard Harris award at the 2023 BIFAs in recognition of her long career in support of independent film, and in 2024, she was the recipient of the BAFTA Fellowship, the highest honour bestowed by the British film industry, for career achievement.\n\nShe'll be in conversation with Kate Hutchinson as they chat about Morton's life through music and an Honest Playlist."},
